{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8a899b878e27d1971399be01dd31a667b52f5e9fc241c250c18ee5a8f6512c75", "ja": "歯車は止まらない", "zh": "齿轮永不停息", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "356b284c72a0191de5ea443c63f597e89e9a0e271d26e5e3520e85a7c29c9c39", "ja": "自分たちの撮影を終え、充実感を感じる\n星梨花たち。それぞれにスチームパンクの\n魅力を再確認しつつ、合流したまつり達と\nともに、まだ撮影の残る仲間たちの激励に\n向かうのだった。", "zh": "结束了自己的拍摄后，星梨花她们感到十分充实。在重新感受到蒸汽朋克魅力的同时，她们和会合的茉莉一行人一起，前去为还要继续拍摄的伙伴们加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed", "ja": "撮影終了後……", "zh": "拍摄结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c890a805c36df3f923de19c02251884485c9df041a46413c32864bc3d95029a8", "ja": "みんな、撮影お疲れ様！", "zh": "大家，拍摄辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "89d3ce50169957a482b99574b7a942b3a5e6e46983c72be3b56ed5628f0cb54a", "ja": "おやぶん、お仕事もう終わりなの？\nたまき、もっと悪者と戦いたいぞ～。", "zh": "老大，工作已经结束了吗？\n环还想继续和坏蛋战斗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "16dec00d09cf84905e8762d7202731db1527a5ef0f131bf406caf403caddb359", "ja": "環ってば、まだそんなに元気なの？\nあんなに走り回ってたのに。", "zh": "环还这么有精神吗？\n明明之前跑来跑去那么久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "441ac152fbe7639e864f4965374527470c368945af008b07cd0f11755b09b8c4", "ja": "アクションシーン、多かったよね～。\n爆発シーンとか、何カットも撮ったりしてさ♪", "zh": "动作场面很多呢～  \n像爆炸场面之类的，还拍了好几个镜头♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "230e8be0a1ff1461b9c6d481eb13128d98d68eef283caa3eab0c66efa6d06d34", "ja": "私は射撃シーンもたくさん撮りました。\nちょっと、気持ちよかったかも……えへへ♪", "zh": "我也拍了很多射击场景。\n感觉还挺爽的……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "3f775fdc6cb536fc26fd280b6897be75b41286f73e19bdc771cefe173c426e88", "ja": "わたし、今回のお仕事で、スチームパンクのよさが\nよくわかった気がします！", "zh": "我觉得，通过这次工作，我更能体会到蒸汽朋克的魅力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "c15b6b48842ab64adcbaf4ef748c76536c184158ff63d7eef246af854f73f2a1", "ja": "うんうん。蒸気がいっぱい出てくる画ってだけで、\n元気が湧いてくるよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！光是看到蒸汽大量涌出的画面，就会让人精神满满呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "2582268b112a62c9e905c875f8fabc9f6c23a074bfcac0c1c6f4de2477a9ea46", "ja": "そうですね。あ、美奈子さんの王子様役も、\nとっても似合ってて、かっこよかったですよ！", "zh": "是啊。啊，美奈子小姐饰演王子也非常合适，帅气极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "2f857d6ad5c650f3444d32d33f917c58700a7753cb9b39960bdb58f15396f063", "ja": "ほんと？　ありがと～！　でも星梨花ちゃんこそ、\n振り回される役で大変だったよね。お疲れ様！", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢～！不过星梨花才是，演那个被折腾来折腾去的角色，很辛苦吧。辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "16430dd34c2d3f3694984ac127352df3cf1df834df86e4cb9b0188f046056386", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ～！\n茜ちゃんたちのモニターチェックもオールOKでした！", "zh": "大家久等啦～！\n小茜她们的监视器检查也全部通过啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "03e1628f6e4919f2600a12bbe23eefb508dce1f5b75cb7e5b5b56e78b329cc0a", "ja": "おー、茜もまつりもお疲れ！　クランクアップが\n揃うなんて、なんか嬉しいよね！", "zh": "哦——茜和小祭也辛苦啦！能一起杀青，总觉得很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "50131dd1e2c99c1453ac59fcfb8e86a1848500fe6a15a98c7146c86d677348ee", "ja": "お疲れさまなのです！　姫は別撮りが多かったので、\n一緒になれて嬉しいのです～♪", "zh": "辛苦了！公主这次大多都是分开拍摄的，能和大家一起真开心呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "aedf64b3efbf95895fb303ba13b93c0f44d0115145bdb424fabd5cc21e571e5f", "ja": "うーむ、今回はまつりちゃんの怖い顔ばっかり\n見てたからね～。その笑顔が逆にほんのり怖いッ！", "zh": "唔，这次一直看到的都是小祭那张可怕的脸～。所以你这个笑容反而让人隐隐觉得有点可怕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "b61d11996e7377ff65d01f223138e575e905fa0325bb14c30d901e3d608c3e0a", "ja": "うん……まつり、すごく怖かった。", "zh": "嗯……茉莉真的很吓人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "396f23664786f6df599b634066be422b5a13f8e3de603b61191851210dd1ad4c", "ja": "ほ？　姫は怖くないのですよ？　マツリロボは\nカチカチでも、まつり姫はふわふわなのです♪", "zh": "咦？公主才不可怕哦？马茨莉机器人虽然硬邦邦的，可茉莉公主可是软绵绵的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ce42495d7a7a29e5bfe02d2bd1a79dd63b39889690d1c7d6d52fda608ae7b48", "ja": "それだけまつりさんが上手だったってことだね。\nお兄ちゃん、他のみんなの撮影は、まだ残ってるの？", "zh": "这就说明小祭你演得很棒呢。哥哥，其他人的拍摄还没结束吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "41b47c246c7aae845b4e95b7c662e51f8238b12a2d78f5ec9b8cdbe6db7c4311", "ja": "ああ。今回は全員、何がしかの役をもらってるからな。\n細かい撮影がまだ続くよ。", "zh": "啊。这次大家都分到了某个角色。\n还有一些细节镜头要继续拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a08f59fa6b16834782190b3ca534cac6e6fecf0bddd048a448dc8471cf862ff", "ja": "それならそっちも応援に行かなきゃだね！\n何かアドバイスできることもあるかもしんないし。", "zh": "既然这样，那边也得去给你加油才行呢！\n说不定还有什么能给你提建议的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "f642525c8128ba535c616aab56d7083fe898e33ddca5ebbe0bc0c96d0818a72c", "ja": "予定合わせて行こっか！\n私、差し入れ用意しておくね♪", "zh": "我们配合一下时间一起去吧！\n我来准备慰问品哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_07_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "2b528b563128ae8d23285eaf3343d0ee835f8888811ce804a64a98961394c05f", "ja": "はい！　きっと、素敵な映画になりますね！", "zh": "好的！一定会拍成一部精彩的电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
